cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "vp-nrf2: NRF2/KEAP1 antioxidant-response activation prediction"
message: "If you use this package, please cite it and the underlying Tox21 data."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Sagace Labs"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Sagace-Labs/vp-nrf2"
license: Apache-2.0
version: "1.0.0"
abstract: >-
  A predictor of NRF2/KEAP1 antioxidant-response activation and of the
  cell-viability loss it is confounded with, from molecular structure.
